==Battleground==
*1 [[Inky Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Blinky Kory]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 44.67 seconds<sup>1,340f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage lacks significant pushing power once the Blinky Kory is dead, and he is very weak to most [[Anti-Red Cats]] like [[Island Cat]] and [[Courier Cat]], who also deal with the support well. To speed up the process, use Rebound units like [[Bullet Train Cat]] and especially [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]], who will continuously attack off of the [[Knockback]] [[Mini-Wave]]s.

